    "Puede ser que tu lista de deseos este vacia, o que sea privada: Steam responde igual en los dos casos.\n\nSi crees que deberia traer algo, en Steam revisa Perfil > Editar perfil > Privacidad y deja \"Lista de deseos\" en publico.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your wishlist may be empty, or it may be private: Steam answers the same either way.\n\nIf you think it should have something, in Steam go to Profile > Edit Profile > Privacy and set \"Game details\" to public."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Que juegas, que no, y donde se va tu tiempo": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you play, what you skip, and where your time goes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Queda solo en GameShelf: tu lista de deseos de Steam no cambia, porque su API no deja escribir.\n\nSe agrega con estado \"Lista de deseos\", y puedes cambiarlo despues desde su ficha.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This stays in GameShelf only: your Steam wishlist does not change, because its API is read-only.\n\nIt is added with the \"Wishlist\" status, and you can change that later from its page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
